# landmark (assets/world3d/mummers/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# Mummers' Hollow: the stage's proscenium with its drawn curtains and tall painted sky, the castle flat cut out above its case, banner poles at the back.
# the proscenium: two columns, a header beam, a pediment and a valance; the drawn curtains behind them
